index dc44ace..11adfc2 100644
--- a/docs/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/docs/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -9,6 +9,8 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0
 
 ### Fixed
 
+- **Diagnostics follow current edits.** Results from older text or a previous opening of a file no longer replace current warnings. Contributed by PHP Workbench (local downstream patch).
+
 - **Type hierarchy opens PHP declarations.** Parent and child source ranges now include class, interface, trait and enum names.
 
 - **Blade function diagnostics stay on user-written PHP.** Generated escape and directive helpers no longer invent undefined-function errors at template delimiters; actual unresolved functions retain their original positions and component attribute diagnostics remain visible. Contributed by PHP Workbench (local downstream patch).
